# Firebase — google-services.json COMMIT karna zaroori hai (gitignore mat karo):
# EAS cloud build server git archive se file uthata hai — gitignored file kabhi nahi
# pahunchti, jisse FCM silently skip ho jata hai. Ye build-time config hai (APK mein
# embed hoti hai), runtime secret nahi. Expo official recommendation: commit karo.
# iOS FCM (GoogleService-Info.plist) — abhi use nahi hota (iOS push = APNs)
GoogleService-Info.plist

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

example

# generated native folders
/ios
/android

.vercel
.env*
